<title>BELGIUM: Belgian money market supply up in week.</title>
<headline>Belgian money market supply up in week.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank said it boosted money market liquidity slightly in the week to June 23.</p>
<p>(figures from the weekly statement in bln francs) -</p>
<p> Foreign currency reserves	   447.51 (-  0.24)</p>
<p> Advances against pledged security  17.30 (+  1.68)</p>
<p> Money market interventions*	 119.89 (+  1.31)</p>
<p>* comprises repurchase agreements and interbank loans</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
